# Per-machine and per-editor state. None of it belongs to the arcade, all of
# it is rewritten constantly, and none of it means anything on another
# machine.
#
# The Android project under apps/ carries its own .gitignore for its build
# output (~180MB of compiled classes and Gradle caches). This file is only
# for the things that turn up loose anywhere in the folder.

# IntelliJ / Android Studio project state, wherever it lands — including
# inside a game folder, which is how it got here.
.idea/
*.iml

# Windows and macOS file-browser droppings.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
